        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n1 4\n3 2 2\n4 4 2 0 8 1\n10 1 3 1\n1 3 9 5\n6 4\n2 2 3\n7 10 5 7\n1 6 2 3\n1 8 0 7 0 2",
        "output": "8.1820424980\n8.6995968482",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nExample case 1:\n\n\nThe black point is ShareChat,\nPoints from the first set are red.\nPoints from the second set are green.\nPoints from the third set are blue.\nThe black line corresponds to Chef's run.\n\nChef should run from (1,4)(1, 4)(1,4) to (3,1)(3, 1)(3,1), then to (2,0)(2, 0)(2,0) and then to (1,3)(1, 3)(1,3). The distance is 13+2+10≐8.1820424980\\sqrt{13}+\\sqrt{2}+\\sqrt{10} \\doteq 8.182042498013​+2​+10​≐8.1820424980.\nExample case 2:\n![](https://codechef_shared.s3.amazonaws.com/download/Images/NOV19/PHCUL/sample-2.jpg =240x303)\nChef should run from (6,4)(6, 4)(6,4) to (5,7)(5, 7)(5,7), then to (1,6)(1, 6)(1,6) and then to (0,7)(0, 7)(0,7). The distance is 10+17+2≐8.6995968482\\sqrt{10}+\\sqrt{17}+\\sqrt{2} \\doteq 8.699596848210​+17​+2​≐8.6995968482."
      }
    ]
